  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and add half the All-American spice blend to wedges, tossing to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-43e90991.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While sweet potato is roasting, pat haloumi dry, then slice to get two pieces per person.\n• Slice red apple (see ingredients) into thin wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-f3f562df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine apple, slaw mix, ranch dressing and a drizzle of olive oil and the white wine vinegar.\n• Season and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-a3d75db0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a shallow bowl, combine the remaining All-American spice blend and the plain flour.\n• In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg.\n• In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi slices into flour mixture to coat, then into egg and finally in panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate. TIP: Press the haloumi firmly into the flour mixture to help it stick!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-c27a6f29.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, add enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-6844c704.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the All-American crumbed haloumi, sweet potato wedges and apple slaw between plates.\n• Serve with dill & parsley mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3d02c674d92e4807a2af7-f1327bd7.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
